{"suttaId":"tha-ap225","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[7829,7851],"vripara":"12"},"segments":{"tha-ap225:0.3":"Dverataniyattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap225:1.1":"“Migaluddo pure āsiṃ, araññe kānane ahaṃ;","tha-ap225:1.3":"Addasaṃ virajaṃ buddhaṃ, āhutīnaṃ paṭiggahaṃ.","tha-ap225:2.1":"“Maṃsapesi mayā dinnā, vipassissa mahesino;","tha-ap225:2.3":"Sadevakasmiṃ lokasmiṃ, issaraṃ kārayāmahaṃ.","tha-ap225:3.1":"“Iminā maṃsadānena, ratanaṃ nibbattate mama;","tha-ap225:3.3":"Duveme ratanā loke, diṭṭhadhammassa pattiyā.","tha-ap225:4.1":"“Tehaṃ sabbe anubhomi, maṃsadānassa sattiyā;","tha-ap225:4.3":"Gattañca mudukaṃ mayhaṃ, paññā nipuṇavedanī.","tha-ap225:5.1":"“Ekanavutito kappe, yaṃ maṃsamadadiṃ tadā;","tha-ap225:5.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, maṃsadānassidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap225:6.1":"“Ito catutthake kappe, eko āsiṃ janādhipo;","tha-ap225:6.3":"Mahārohitanāmo so, cakkavattī mahabbalo.","tha-ap225:7.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap225:8.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā dverataniyo [dvirataniyo (sī.)] thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap225:9.1":"Dverataniyattherassāpadānaṃ tatiyaṃ.","tha-ap225:9.2":"Dasamaṃ bhāṇavāraṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null,"tika2":null}
